# Build artefacts — regenerated by scripts/.
out/
*.built.html
__pycache__/
.DS_Store

# The font bundle IS shipped. assets/fonts/ is committed on purpose: a fresh
# clone with no network has to render exactly what the author rendered, and a
# missing glyph does not fail — the browser substitutes a system face that
# happens to exist on the machine that built the page and on nobody else's.
# Extend it with:
#   python3 scripts/fetch_fonts.py <page> --profile all \
#       --charset assets/fonts/charset.txt
